[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Changelog[/B][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B][[COLOR=#5b9bd5]1.0.7[/COLOR]] - 2026-05-24[/B][/SIZE]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#e8a838][B]» Geändert[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Code Refactoring:[/B] Removed the wrapper class [ICODE]de.zfzfg.pvpwager.utils.MultiverseHelper.java[/ICODE]
[*]The Multiverse functionality now uses the central [ICODE]de.zfzfg.core.world.MultiverseHelper[/ICODE] class directly
[*]This change simplifies the codebase by removing an unnecessary abstraction layer
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#57bb57][B]» Hinzugefügt[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Version Check Command:[/B] Added [ICODE]/epvp version[/ICODE] and [ICODE]/eventpvp version[/ICODE] commands
  [LIST]
  [*]Requires [ICODE]eventpvp.admin[/ICODE] permission (same as reload/debug)
  [*]Displays current plugin version
  [*]Triggers update check and shows update status
  [*]Shows download link if update is available
  [*]Added to help menu and tab completion
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Command Cooldown System:[/B] Integrated [ICODE]CommandCooldownManager[/ICODE] into the main plugin
  [LIST]
  [*]Applied to [ICODE]/pvp challenge[/ICODE] command with 3-second default cooldown
  [*]Includes memory leak prevention with automatic player cleanup on quit
  [*]Customizable cooldown messages via message provider
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Web Server Rate Limiting:[/B] Added rate limiting to the embedded HTTP server
  [LIST]
  [*]Prevents API abuse with per-IP rate counters (100 requests per window)
  [*][COLOR=#e8a838][B]Note:[/B][/COLOR] Rate limit counters are not automatically cleared - may require future cleanup mechanism
  [*]Improves security and stability of the web interface
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Text Utility Performance:[/B] Added color caching to [ICODE]TextUtil[/ICODE]
  [LIST]
  [*]Caches colored text to improve performance
  [*]Reduces redundant color code processing
  [*][COLOR=#e8a838][B]Note:[/B][/COLOR] Cache has no size limit - may require monitoring for memory usage with many unique messages
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Improved Task Management:[/B] Enhanced countdown task handling in [ICODE]MatchManager[/ICODE]
  [LIST]
  [*]Changed from single task to task list for better management
  [*]Allows multiple concurrent countdown operations
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Memory Management:[/B] Added player cleanup method to prevent memory leaks
  [LIST]
  [*][ICODE]CommandCooldownManager.removePlayer()[/ICODE] called on player quit
  [*]Ensures proper cleanup of player-specific data
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Update Reminder System:[/B] Added automatic update checking via Modrinth API
  [LIST]
  [*]Checks for newer plugin versions on server startup with configurable delay
  [*]Notifies admins with [ICODE]eventpvp.admin.updatenotify[/ICODE] permission on join
  [*]Console logging when updates are available
  [*]Caching mechanism to prevent repeated API calls
  [*]Configurable via [ICODE]settings.update-check[/ICODE] in config.yml
  [*]Supports all languages: German, English, Spanish, French, Japanese, Polish, Russian
  [*]Includes proper User-Agent header for Modrinth API compliance
  [*]SemVer-based version comparison
  [*]Uses Modrinth project ID [ICODE]pqJQdZ6R[/ICODE]
  [/LIST]
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#e05252][B]» Gefixt[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Missing Help Message Keys:[/B] Fixed YAML key collision causing help messages to be missing
  [LIST]
  [*]Root cause: Multiple duplicate [ICODE]help:[/ICODE] sections in YAML files caused key collision (YAML only keeps last instance)
  [*]Renamed sections to [ICODE]event-help:[/ICODE], [ICODE]pvp-help:[/ICODE], and [ICODE]command-help:[/ICODE] in all language files
  [*]Updated [ICODE]EventCommand.java[/ICODE] to use [ICODE]event-help.[/ICODE] prefix for all help message lookups
  [*]Fixed [ICODE]/event help[/ICODE] command showing raw message keys instead of actual text
  [*]Applied to all languages: German, English, Spanish, French, Japanese, Polish, and Russian
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Incorrect Command Documentation:[/B] Updated PvP help to show correct command syntax
  [LIST]
  [*]Changed [ICODE]/pvp <spieler>[/ICODE] to [ICODE]/pvpask <spieler>[/ICODE] in all language files
  [*]Updated [ICODE]help.challenge[/ICODE] entries to reference the correct command with Wager-GUI hint
  [*]Applied to all languages with appropriate translations
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Win/Loss Screen Placeholders:[/B] Fixed YAML key collision causing win/loss messages to show as placeholders
  [LIST]
  [*]Root cause: Multiple duplicate [ICODE]match:[/ICODE] sections in YAML files caused key collision
  [*]Renamed sections to [ICODE]match-display:[/ICODE], [ICODE]match-system:[/ICODE], and [ICODE]match-manager:[/ICODE] in all language files
  [*]Updated [ICODE]MatchManager.java[/ICODE] [ICODE]getMsg()[/ICODE] method to route keys to correct YAML section based on key name
  [*]Fixed [ICODE]you-won-header[/ICODE], [ICODE]you-won[/ICODE], [ICODE]you-lost-header[/ICODE], and [ICODE]you-lost[/ICODE] keys not being found
  [*]Applied to all language files
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Draw Vote Expiration Bug:[/B] Fixed "expired" message showing after draw is accepted
  [LIST]
  [*]Added [ICODE]match.isDrawVoteActive()[/ICODE] check in [ICODE]DrawSubCommand.java[/ICODE] timeout task
  [*]Prevents showing expired message when draw vote has already been accepted and deactivated
  [*]Resolves race condition where timeout task fires after draw acceptance
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Update Checker Version Parsing:[/B] Fixed version comparison failing with non-numeric suffixes
  [LIST]
  [*]Updated [ICODE]UpdateChecker.java[/ICODE] to extract numeric part before parsing (e.g., [ICODE]"1.0.6-Multilingual" -> "1.0.6"[/ICODE])
  [*]Prevents [ICODE]NumberFormatException[/ICODE] when comparing versions with suffixes like [ICODE]-Multilingual[/ICODE]
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Error Handling Improvements:[/B] Added logging to all previously empty catch blocks
  [LIST]
  [*][ICODE]MatchManager[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for task cancellation failures, snapshot save errors, and statistics recording failures
  [*][ICODE]EventSession[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for task cleanup failures, inventory snapshot errors, and health/food level setting errors
  [*][ICODE]EquipmentManager[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for allowed worlds parsing errors
  [*][ICODE]PvpStatsStorage[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for UUID parsing errors
  [*][ICODE]SpawnManager[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for teleport fallback failures
  [*][ICODE]RequestManager[/ICODE] & [ICODE]CommandRequestManager[/ICODE]: Added warning logs for task cancellation errors
  [*][ICODE]InventorySnapshotStorage[/ICODE]: Added comment for regex error handling (expected fallback behavior)
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Enum Switch Completeness:[/B] Added missing [ICODE]COMMAND[/ICODE] case to spawn type switch in [ICODE]EventSession[/ICODE]
  [LIST]
  [*]Resolves compiler warning about unhandled enum constant
  [*]Delegates to [ICODE]executeSpawnCommand()[/ICODE] method for command-based spawning
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Material Caching:[/B] Added material name cache to [ICODE]EquipmentManager[/ICODE]
  [LIST]
  [*]Caches [ICODE]Material.valueOf()[/ICODE] lookups to avoid repeated parsing
  [*]Cache is cleared on equipment reload to ensure consistency
  [/LIST]
[*][B]Enchantment Caching:[/B] Added enchantment cache to [ICODE]EquipmentManager[/ICODE]
  [LIST]
  [*]Caches [ICODE]Registry.ENCHANTMENT.get()[/ICODE] lookups for enchantment names
  [*]Cache is cleared on equipment reload to ensure consistency
  [/LIST]
[*][B]HashMap Cloning Reduction:[/B] Replaced defensive copies with unmodifiable views
  [LIST]
  [*][ICODE]MatchManager.getMatches()[/ICODE] now returns [ICODE]Collections.unmodifiableMap()[/ICODE]
  [*][ICODE]StatsManager.toMap()[/ICODE] now returns [ICODE]Collections.unmodifiableMap()[/ICODE]
  [*]Reduces memory allocation for admin/debug commands
  [/LIST]
[/LIST]

