[SIZE=4][COLOR=#e8a838][B]» Upgrade Hinweise[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[QUOTE][B]Language Files:[/B] Language files are NOT automatically replaced when updating the plugin. If you have customized language files ([ICODE]messages_*.yml[/ICODE]), you need to delete them from the plugin data folder and restart the server to let the plugin regenerate them with the new update notification messages, then manually reapply your customizations.[/QUOTE]

